  "limits": [
    "The original records did not pin output digests. This addendum identifies surviving originals by their embedded run, input and checker identities; it is not a retroactive signed execution attestation.",
    "accepted-predecessor/ contains the later replay on historical code, not the original P9-1.7-1.8 execution, which is preserved separately.",
    "The initial P9-1.6-1.8 development failure raw output was overwritten before archival. Its existing AuditClosure summary remains the record; no reconstruction is claimed.",
    "Routine failed attempts are not bundled. Relevant causes, corrections and remaining limits remain in the existing execution/audit summaries.",
    "Browser screenshots and saved surface output are supporting artifacts. Their capture is not an independent attestation or runtime conformance evidence.",
    "Publication normalizes machine-local path text. Original hashes remain citable, but original byte identity cannot be recomputed from the normalized bytes alone."
  ],
