    },
    "hash_semantics": "archive/artifact sha256 and normalized_receipt_digest/normalized_report_digest verify published normalized bytes. original_sha256/original_bytes and embedded digest references cite the original unnormalized bytes; they are not checksums of the normalized preimages.",
